# LLM credentials (read by the Tauri/Rust backend only).
#
# Setup:
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # edit .env with your real key
#
# The app loads `.env` (project root or src-tauri/). It does NOT read this file.
# Never commit `.env`.

# --- Google Gemini (Google AI Studio) — preferred when set ---
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-google-ai-studio-key-here
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-google-ai-studio-key-here   # also accepted
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
# Optional: LLM_PROVIDER=gemini

# --- Claude (Anthropic) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-20250514
# Optional: LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# --- OpenAI-compatible (OpenAI, OpenRouter, etc.) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# Optional: LLM_PROVIDER=openai

# --- Segmentation (frontend) ---
# Default: SegFormer-B0 ADE20K via Transformers.js (~13MB ONNX, downloaded once).
# Alternatives:
#   VITE_PIXLE_SEGMENTER=segformer      # neural (default)
#   VITE_PIXLE_SEGMENTER=sky-heuristic  # classical sky-only fallback
#   VITE_PIXLE_SEGMENTER=stub           # empty masks (global edits only)
#
# Debug mask overlay (dev): localStorage pixle.debugMasks=1 or Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+M
# Also: ?debugMasks=1 in the URL.
